#. The "Cookie settings" button is intentionally left in English: parts/footer.html
#. (out of scope for this branch) still renders that label as literal English in
#. every language. Translating it here would send users looking for a control
#. that doesn't exist. Revisit once the footer i18n follow-up lands.
